<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets 100 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets 100 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Daiwa Europe and HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN  LSHG.D</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    29.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.96    PAY DATE  L-18.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.56     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT DECEMBER 2000 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
